    "slug": "fire-escape",
    "title": "Fire escape",
    "medium": "Painting",
    "file": "fire-escape-portfolio.webp",
    "description": "",
    "thoughtProcess": [
      "I was walking through Lower Haight in the early evening when the light hitting the side of this building reminded me of my childhood bedroom: a green wall brightened and warmed by the sunset.",
      "I also found the composition enticing: the light against the cooler shadow, with laundry hanging out of the window. It reminded me of the beauty of the mundane, and I wanted to capture that."
    ],
