  {
    "slug": "flower-studies",
    "title": "Flower studies",
    "medium": "Paintings",
    "file": "flower-pink-portfolio.webp",
    "description": "",
    "thoughtProcess": [
      "These were some of my favorite plants at the Conservatory of Flowers. The one on the right has a whole ecosystem living in its center, with water, bugs, and bacteria.",
      "I started with the flower in the middle, then expanded to the other two and thought they would work well as a triptych.",
      "These flower studies were also a way for me to get more comfortable with gouache."
    ],
