    "slug": "portrait-study",
    "title": "Portrait study",
    "medium": "Drawing",
    "file": "arena-50968843.webp",
    "description": "",
    "thoughtProcess": [
      "I’ve done self-portraits for most of my sketches throughout my life, whether I wanted to or not. I guess since I’m most familiar with my own face, I see nearly every face I draw as a reinterpretation of myself.",
      "This was a quick study I did for an oil painting class before we started painting faces. I think I did a good job of capturing my likeness and getting the proportions right."
    ],
