    "slug": "kestrel",
    "title": "Kestrel",
    "medium": "Figma",
    "file": "kestrel.webp",
    "description": "",
    "thoughtProcess": [
      "This was a commission from my friend’s startup in college, which was a bank specializing in providing loans to agriculture. Since the name of their startup was Kestrel and it previously had a bird design on it, I took the same bird design but made it more explicit in its messaging of providing support to agriculture.",
      "The lines represent the lines of crops you would see in the field, but can also be interpreted as the wing of the kestrel."
    ],
